# reject-obo-cycle — the on-behalf-of relation must be acyclic: a <-> b is a cycle
# in the principal chain, ill-formed at apply even though no grant amplifies
# (equal risk sets satisfy the subset check both ways) (§5.1, §6).
actor a on-behalf-of b
actor b on-behalf-of a
gate g risk low grant a[deploy:low] b[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
